WEBVTT

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.250
Due to Dark Tinker's monster 
effect, I draw a card!

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.740
Yusei, listen and learn!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.120
Everyone is powerless against the King!

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.140
This is the power of the King!

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.480
Absolute Powerforce!

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:25.900
The King's Red Dragon Archfiend 
destroys Junk Warrior!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.520
See that, Yusei?

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.930
Weak excuses don't work against the King!

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:35.500
The only thing left for you 
after this duel will be defeat!

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.400
I set three cards and end my turn!

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:13.400
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.410
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:26.940
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.910
Break through even further

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:38.430
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:45.570
There's always only one truth

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.430
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.250
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:54.640 --> 00:02:00.370
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:35.480
Destiny of the Signers!
Crimson Dragon Leads to the Future!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:49.830
What's that?

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.330
It was sunny just a little while ago.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.410
Can it be?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:59.980
Just as Bro said, is there really a curse 
when Signers battle against each other?

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:02.110
There's no way that's true!

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.920
More importantly, make 
sure to cheer for Yusei!

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:11.170
Director, at the risk of sounding 
forward, can I ask you something?

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.320
What is it?

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:18.380
Our goal was to awaken the four Signers.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:25.150
Now that we've accomplished that, is there a 
reason why we're continuing this tournament?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:31.990
Security is thinking about the safety 
of the citizens.  I don't disagree.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:38.370
So you don't want to see the 
power of the Crimson Dragon?

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:42.940
But you can only see the Crimson Dragon's 
power when five Signers gather...

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.980
No way! The fifth Signer is in the stadium?

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:50.700
The mark of the Crimson 
Dragon is already complete?

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.480
Who knows?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:58.780
However, by the time this duel is over, 
we'll witness something interesting.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:04.870
My turn!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.580
All right, I can do it.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.670
I activate my trap Descending Lost Star!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.540
I lower the Level of a Synchro 
Monster in my graveyard by

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:16.540
one and Special Summon it to the 
field with 0 defense points!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:19.090
Resurrect, Junk Warrior!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.290
Then I summon Hyper Synchron!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:31.970
Level 4 Hyper Synchron tunes 
the now Level 4 Junk Warrior!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.780
Four plus four is?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:40.800
Eight!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:46.550
The wishes come together to form a new 
shining star!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.590
Synchro Summon!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.710
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.070
You've arrived, Stardust!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.450
It's coming.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.950
Stardust Dragon has appeared!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:17.150
Will we finally see the main 
monsters of these rivals battle?

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:22.120
What's going on?

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:28.790
What incredible energy frequencies!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:32.830
Incredible!  This is becoming incredible!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.280
Hyper Synchron's monster effect activates!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:42.320
When Hyper Synchron is used as Synchro 
Material, the Synchro Monster gains 800 attack points!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.060
Now I activate my trap!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.940
Tuner Capture!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.310
When the opponent Synchro 
Summons, I can Special

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:56.310
Summon a Synchro Material 
Monster from your graveyard!

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:59.020
Join my field!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.490
Come, Hyper Synchron!

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:07.310
Whoa!  The King resurrected 
Yusei's monster on to his field!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:11.060
Stardust Dragon attacks Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.010
The King alreadys know what 
you're planning to do!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.960
I activate my trap!  Tuner's Mind!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:26.820
When my Synchro Monster is attacked, it 
reverts back to its Synchro Material Monsters!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:31.890
If I leave Twin-Sword Marauder 
alone, he will use Hyper

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:36.890
Synchron to Synchro Summon Red 
Dragon Archfiend on the next turn.

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.510
In that case…

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.820
Stardust Dragon attacks Twin-Sword Marauder!

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:44.550
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:48.390
What?

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:52.570
I told you!  I already 
know all your strategies!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:59.980
The Tuner Monster that appeared due to Tuner's 
Mind must battle against your attacking monster!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.830
I activate the Continuous Trap Synchro Blast!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:15.030
With Synchro Blast, when my Synchro Monster 
attacks, you take 500 points of damage!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:19.990
Since Dark Tinker was sent to the 
graveyard, I get to draw one card.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.780
I end my turn.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.350
My turn!

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:30.600
Hyper Synchron tunes Twin-Sword Marauder!

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:46.580
The pulse of the King now forms a line 
here!  Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:48.810
Synchro Summon!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.530
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.900
Look at this glorious sight!

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:59.260
My most powerful servant and I walk 
the path of the King together!

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:05.850
Since Hyper Synchron was used as Synchro 
Material, Red Dragon Archfiend gains 800 attack points!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:08.540
It's coming.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.330
Take this!  Absolute Powerforce!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:18.920
Since Hyper Synchron was used as Synchro 
Material, Stardust Dragon isn't destroyed in battle!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.280
I know that!

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:22.810
I activate my trap Fiend Cannon!

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:30.680
If I failed to destroy your monster in 
battle, you take 500 points of damage!

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.270
Yusei!

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:35.620
This is bad.  Yusei's life 
points are below 1000!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.350
It's here!

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.440
Crimson Dragon.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:52.400
What?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.150
Can it be?

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.210
Am I seeing things?

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:14.990
What is that?

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.220
When did they summon that monster?

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:20.230
Crimson Dragon!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:23.870
What?  My mark is burning...

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:30.330
That's the Crimson Dragon …

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.470
Crimson Dragon has appeared.

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.270
Please connect me to Akutsu.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:50.510
Moment is shining so bright 
that it's incredible!

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:55.050
Akutsu, please stop Moment immediately.

00:09:56.250 --> 00:10:01.590
What are you talking about?  
Moment is working so well.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.060
This is an order.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:07.170
If you value your life, 
then stop immediately.

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:11.880
Do you want to be destroyed, 
just like Bommer's hometown?

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:14.110
Director?

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:19.300
Temperature and pressure are both 
rapidly rising inside Moment!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.620
We're passing the critical limit!  
The system can't handle it!

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:27.540
If you value your life…

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.490
Just like Bommer's hometown…

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.100
To all workers, stop Moment!

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:42.420
Cut all Moment systems immediately!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.690
We finally meet, Crimson Dragon!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:10.120
Watch our duel closely!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:12.410
Jack, this is dangerous!

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:15.920
If we continue this duel, I 
don't know what will happen!

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.480
Are you scared, Yusei?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:21.440
A person who's afraid of the future 
doesn't have the right to be a duelist!

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:25.600
Even if heaven and earth are 
destroyed, I'll continue to duel!

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:29.180
All the requirements have now been met.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:36.240
When Signers unleash their true power in 
battle, the duel enters a new dimension.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:40.490
The power that was split into 
five pieces now come together.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:42.210
Dragon head.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:11:59.360
What?

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.470
Where am I?

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.440
What?

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:28.700
Where am I?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:30.670
Aki.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.320
What's going on?

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.070
Yusei…

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.540
That's...

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.890
What's that?

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:57.810
They're the people of the stars 
that Godwin told me about.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.040
People of the stars?

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.950
They have the same mark as us.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:19.290
Does this mean that we, the Signers, are 
linked by destiny that transcends time?

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.610
That's Neo Domino City and Satellite!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.950
What?  What's going on?

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.320
That's…

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:41.730
A spider.  There's a spider 
geoglyph in Satellite.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.530
Satellite is being destroyed.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.940
What is this?

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:53.160
Can this be the future?

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:57.150
Is it destiny that Satellite 
will be destroyed?

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.480
No way!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.240
Yusei!  I'm continuing the duel!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.220
What?

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:07.540
Even if this duel leads to hell, 
I'll still finish things with you!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.520
Jack!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:12.880
Don't you understand?  Our duel led us here!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:17.510
So in order to leave this place, 
we have to finish our duel!

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:20.460
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.690
My turn!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:29.630
From my hand, I activate the 
Speed Spell Silver Contrails!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:37.770
When I have 5 or more Speed Counters, my 
Wind Attribute monster gains 1000 attack points!

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:40.980
Stardust Dragon!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.750
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.690
What's this pain?

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:53.770
I actually felt the attack.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:57.600
So this is what a real battle 
between Signers is like!

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:01.210
Then the Continuous Trap Synchro Blast!

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:08.470
Since Hyper Synchron was used as Synchro

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.470
Material, Red Dragon Archfiend 
isn't destroyed in battle!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.110
It's the same as Stardust Dragon!

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:17.920
From now on, it's a battle 
between our strengths!

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:25.100
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:30.720
Three set cards.  He's coming at me!

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:41.660
My turn!

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:46.920
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Stardust Dragon!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.510
Absolute Powerforce!

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:54.850
Yusei!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:58.630
Is that power the same as mine?

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:01.690
Did I actually feel that attack?

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.880
This is a real battle between Signers!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:05.810
What?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:11.150
If we let our guard down, our souls will 
disintegrate before the duel is over!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.900
I activate my trap!  Crossline Counter!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:17.500
When I take battle damage 
during your turn, my

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.500
monster gains attack points 
equal to double the damage.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.000
Then it battles against the 
monster that dealt the damage!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.150
That's the spirit!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.980
Stardust Dragon!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.260
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.270
Jack!

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:43.270
If you have time to worry about me, 
then you should worry about yourself!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.500
I activate the Speed Spell Overboost!

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:52.180
My Speed Counters increase 
by 4 this turn, becoming 11!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.700
He instantly sped up to 11!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:59.480
Yusei!  I'll finish you with 
the same card from last time!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:03.350
I activate the Speed Spell End of the Storm!

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:10.270
When I have ten or more Speed 
Counters, all monsters on the

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:15.270
field are destroyed and deal 300 
points of damage per monster!

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.450
Stardust Dragon's monster effect activates!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.150
When an effect that destroys 
cards on the field

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:24.150
activates, I can negate that effect 
by releasing Stardust Dragon!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:27.310
That's right!  That's the 
only choice you have, Yusei!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:32.260
Because if End of the Storm's effect 
activates, your life points will become zero!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.850
I'll finish you with this!

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:37.040
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Sneak Exploder!

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:41.320
During your next turn's Standby 
Phase, by sending this card to the

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:46.320
graveyard, you take 500 points of 
damage for every monster on my field!

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:47.860
Yusei!

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:51.450
At this rate, Yusei will lose next turn!

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:57.300
At the End Phase of this turn, Stardust Dragon 
returns to the field due to its monster effect!

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:01.930
I activate a trap!  Meteor Stream!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:08.490
When a monster on the field is released and then 
Special Summoned, you take 1000 points of damage!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.970
I was waiting for this moment!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:18.830
My previous defeat foreshadowed that 
I would prove that I'm the real King!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:22.740
I activate my trap!  Crimson Fire!

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:27.870
It negates the damage from a card effect 
and deals you double the damage!

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:31.460
Take this!  Crimson Fire!

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.090
Yusei!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:38.560
I activate my trap Shining Silver Force!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:45.740
It negates the damage from your trap, and all 
spell and trap cards on your field are destroyed!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.110
How annoying!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:56.000
At the end of your turn, Overboost's effect 
ends, and your Speed Counters drop to 1.

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:08.650
My turn!

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:14.100
Speed Spell Final Attack!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:20.210
When I have 8 or more Speed Counters, the 
attack points of one monster is doubled!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:26.460
5000 attack points?

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:32.890
This is the end!  Our bond loses to no one!

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:34.750
Stardust Dragon!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.700
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.900
What happened?

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.440
Just when I thought the Crimson Dragon flew

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:30.660
away, everything in front 
of me became really bright!

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.170
Look at that!

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.760
Jack's life points!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:41.350
Yusei won this duel.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.310
The King lost!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.920
Are you okay, Jack?

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.690
Impossible...

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:59.050
I, the King, lost again?

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:04.050
I knew you would try to defeat me 
using the same strategy as before.

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:08.570
Since you want to be the King, 
you lost against your own pride.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:13.270
I lost because of the King...

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.630
What happened?

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:19.410
What's wrong?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.350
The duel is over.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:25.690
It's finally over!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:28.580
The winner is Yusei Fudo!

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:36.050
King Jack Atlas's undefeated legend is over, 
and we're witnessing the birth of a new King!

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:40.100
The new King's name is Yusei Fudo!

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:42.360
Yusei Fudo is the new King!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:49.000
The new King is from Satellite!

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:09.390
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:14.780
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:20.710
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:25.950
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:29.100
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.670 --> 00:22:34.690
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:41.880
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.030 --> 00:22:47.310
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:53.200
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:58.570
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.170 --> 00:23:04.680
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:14.090
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
